<p class="text-center"><a href="/science-data/science-research/research-centres/retscreen-innovation-lab"><strong>RETScreen<br>
Innovation Lab </strong></a></p>
</div>

<div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4"><a href="/science-data/science-research/research-centres/retscreen-data-onboarding"><img alt class="img-responsive mrgn-bttm-md center-block" src="/sites/nrcan/files/canmetenergy/images/RETScreen-(3)-Data-Onboarding%20(Custom).png"></a>

